"## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] An externally squash-merged multi-commit pull request whose merge tree equals the accepted head tree and whose merge parent is an ancestor of the accepted head is proven to be a squash. <!-- aitm-verified key=\"047b98ce\" vc-list=\"vc:7\" worktree=\"/Users/kpburson/projects/Vibe-Coding/ai-task-manager/.worktrees/1490-squash-delivery-proof\" branch=\"codex/defect-1490-squash-delivery-proof\" bound-issue=\"1490\" -->\n- [ ] A multi-commit rebase topology is refused, because the merge parent is a newly created rewrite and is not an ancestor of the accepted head. <!-- aitm-verified key=\"d8495771\" vc-list=\"vc:7\" worktree=\"/Users/kpburson/projects/Vibe-Coding/ai-task-manager/.worktrees/1490-squash-delivery-proof\" branch=\"codex/defect-1490-squash-delivery-proof\" bound-issue=\"1490\" -->\n- [ ] An ordinary two-parent merge, a fast-forward, a tree mismatch, a reverted descendant, and an incomplete source inventory each still refuse. <!-- aitm-verified key=\"2b2b0f48\" vc-list=\"vc:7\" worktree=\"/Users/kpburson/projects/Vibe-Coding/ai-task-manager/.worktrees/1490-squash-delivery-proof\" branch=\"codex/defect-1490-squash-delivery-proof\" bound-issue=\"1490\" -->\n- [ ] Existing single-source external-squash, provider-action, current-head, and historical-intent recovery paths keep their present behavior. <!-- aitm-verified key=\"8f1b4b17\" vc-list=\"vc:1 vc:7\" worktree=\"/Users/kpburson/projects/Vibe-Coding/ai-task-manager/.worktrees/1490-squash-delivery-proof\" branch=\"codex/defect-1490-squash-delivery-proof\" bound-issue=\"1490\" -->\n- [ ] An externally squash-merged multi-commit pull request carrying GitHub’s default squash body is proven by exact title prefix plus exact authorized token set with no `Attribution:` trailer, while a missing or extra token, and any malformed canonical-looking trailer including an indented one, each refuse. <!-- aitm-verified key=\"82a7f727\" vc-list=\"vc:7\" worktree=\"/Users/kpburson/projects/Vibe-Coding/ai-task-manager/.worktrees/1490-squash-delivery-proof\" branch=\"codex/defect-1490-squash-delivery-proof\" bound-issue=\"1490\" -->\n\n"